\title{phyloatlas: R access to the Phylo-Species Atlas}
\description{
Convenience functions to fetch phylogenetic trees and metadata from the
Phylo-Species Atlas directly from R.
}
\details{
Key functions:
\itemize{
  \item \code{\link{load_atlas_tree}} - load a tree by name.
  \item \code{\link{list_trees}} - data frame of all available trees.
  \item \code{\link{atlas_info}} - metadata for a single tree.
  \item \code{\link{atlas_clear_cache}} - drop the in-session cache.
}
The atlas lives at
\url{https://github.com/franciscorichter/phylo-species-atlas}.
}
